AGENTIC LIQUIDITY RAILS (ALR) CONFIGURATION
Algorand Testnet Node
ALGOD_SERVER=https://testnet-api.algonode.cloud
ALGOD_TOKEN=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
ALGOD_PORT=443

Agent Wallet (For providing/managing liquidity)
DO NOT share your real mnemonic. Use a dedicated Testnet account.
AGENT_MNEMONIC="your secret twenty four word mnemonic phrase"

Liquidity Strategy Settings
Maximum slippage allowed (e.g., 0.5%)
MAX_SLIPPAGE_TOLERANCE=0.005

Minimum liquidity depth required before execution (in microAlgos)
MIN_POOL_LIQUIDITY=1000000

Automated Rebalancing Interval (in seconds)
REBALANCE_FREQUENCY=3600

Logging & Monitoring
LOG_LEVEL=info
